OL,3,GNEWSAMan left 'traumatised' after
OL,4,Aracist attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who had his leg injured in a
OL,7,Fracially-motivated attack has described
OL,8,Fthe ordeal as incredibly traumatic.
OL,10,FThe man, who wishes to remain
OL,11,Fanonymous, said that both he and a
OL,12,Fwoman were chatting when they were both
OL,13,Fsubjected to racial abuse before being
OL,14,Fattacked by a group of men, one of whom
OL,15,Fwas armed with a baton.
OL,17,FPolice are treating three assaults and
OL,18,Fcriminal damage in the Waterside area
OL,19,Fof Londonderry on Sunday night as
OL,20,Fracially-motivated hate crimes and
OL,21,Fbelieve they may be linked.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
